**/bin

# the two names liveprobe/README.md tells an operator to build into this tracked directory.
# `**/bin` does not match them, and the tracked 35 MB binary this replaced is why they are here.
liveprobe/liveprobe
liveprobe/liveprobe-arm64
# and the Windows spelling, which neither name above matches: `go build` in this directory on
# Windows writes liveprobe.exe, 36 MB. It was staged once, on 2026-09-17, before this line existed.
liveprobe/*.exe
# livepeer is liveprobe's second half -- the other party, in its own process -- and its build
# output has exactly the same shape and the same 36 MB. Same three names, before the first
# `git add .` in this directory rather than after it.
livepeer/livepeer
livepeer/livepeer-arm64
livepeer/*.exe
build/apple*
build/ios*
build/android*
build/node_modules
**/.DS_Store
**/test.out
js/js

temp/*

.vscode/*
.direnv

# agent planning artifacts -- internal workflow, never shipped upstream
.superpowers/
docs/superpowers/

# a compiled test binary was tracked at the repo root until 2026-09-24; `go test -c`
# writes one here by default and it is 20+ MB of build output, not source.
*.test
# Language package outputs and isolated build tools.
packaging/.venv/
packaging/__pycache__/
python/dist/
python/build/
python/src/urnetwork/native/
python/**/__pycache__/
python/src/*.egg-info/
